@sellerToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6ImNtbGlwY3UwZTAwMDB2ODh0bmhxb2IxcmIiLCJlbWFpbCI6InNlbGxlckB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJTRUxMRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA4NTUwMjAsImV4cCI6MTc3MDk0MTQyMH0.xItKMKPiyS_4Ki6gwMhK3lpsWc__BnzHH8S0zhMIJQQ  
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6ImNtbGlwY3UxcDAwMDF2ODh0a2ZyeDJmbnoiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQHRlc3QuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IkFETUlOIiwiaWF0IjoxNzcwODU1MDIwLCJleHAiOjE3NzA5NDE0MjB9.zKmNMjkQjp8fnSxEo-9Gmb2CiBGkVkKO6eM-u6HC7Ig

@userId = {{profile.response.body.data.id}}

### 0. [공통] 내 정보 조회 (ID 확인용)
# @name profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 1. [고객] 포인트 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 2. [고객] 포인트 충전 (10,000P)
POST {{baseUrl}}/points/charge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "amount": 10000,
  "paymentKey": "test_payment_key_{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "orderId": "test_order_id_{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### 3. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 4. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회 (충전만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?type=CHARGE
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. [관리자] 포인트 지급 

POST {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 5000,
  "memo": "이벤트 참여 보상"
}

### 6. [관리자] 포인트 차감 
POST {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": -1000,
  "memo": "관리자 차감 테스트"
}

### 7. [관리자] 전체 포인트 내역 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/admin/history?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. [판매자] 매출 정산 요약 (2026년 2월)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/seller/settlement?year=2026&month=2
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 9. [판매자] 거래 내역 조회

### 10. [고객] 예약 생성 (환불 테스트용)
# class.http에서 생성한 slotId 필요

@classId = cmlj8jlck0008vg8twpvj5j36
@slotId = cmlj8jycc0009vg8teje5g20l
@reservationId = cmlj8idjz0005vg8t8d9kwz0f

POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

### 11. [고객] 예약 취소 (환불 발생)
# 위 요청에서 생성된 reservationId 필요
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "단순 변심"
}

### 12. [판매자] 클래스 삭제 (환불 발생)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 13. [고객] 포인트 내역 조회 (환불만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/points/me/history?type=REFUND
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
